  "description": "WP-M4c Codex: Space Marines (11e) FEARSOME ASSAULT (Reiver Squad), RIGHTEOUS FURY and PRESS THE ATTACK (Captain Titus). Fixture sm11e_m4c_fight (P1 Space Marines' Fight phase): Captain Titus (3/6 W) leads an Intercessor Squad engaged with the Warboss; a Reiver Squad is engaged with the Boyz. At the start of the Fight phase the Boyz make a battle-shock roll at -1 (Game Log). Selecting the Intercessors to fight (real click in the fight panel) opens P1's unit_selected_to_fight window with the free Righteous Fury card (once per battle): a real click gives the unit's melee attacks +1 S (and Press the Attack's [SUSTAINED HITS 1] vs the non-VEHICLE Warboss); when the unit has fought, Titus heals D3.",
  "fixture": "sm11e_m4c_fight",
  "edition": 11,
  "rng_seed": 11,
  "transition_to_phase": 10,
  "disable_ai": true,
  "sm_abilities_c": true,
